[h2]Build 0.9.6[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Capsules have a weight limit of 40 kg. A full capsule is a full stack, or as much as fits under the limit: 75 steel or 10 meals still go in one, but only 40 uranium. A single item heavier than the limit still goes, one per capsule.
[*]Launch air now depends on weight: half the usual burst for a nearly empty capsule, one and a half times at the weight limit. The sender shows what its waiting capsule will cost, and capsules show their weight.
[*][b]As above, So below:[/b] capsules sent between levels now take the time of the same trip on one level plus a little per level, instead of flying the long way round the map's hidden rows.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Pack bills are now named by how full the capsule is (full, half full, tenth full) rather than by stack size. Existing bills keep working.
[/list]
